{"version":1,"content":"<p>北海道厚岸町是知名的蠔（日語稱為牡蠣） 產地，品質肥厚、味道甘甜兼口感Creamy，令人想一嘗為快。</p><p>當地有一座匯集4間餐廳的商場，從炭火燒蠔到蠔餅漢堡一應俱全。</p><p>意猶未盡的話，札幌市另有一間主打多種蠔菜式的餐館，讓大家盡享滋味！</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:46.151445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:00:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.632999+00:00","content_hash":"05ada577ad096b6827e25f5855c5f8ded3474bd1745987c0f1a4be0e4abf946f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}